      "group_path": [
        34,
        36
      ],
      "source_text": "DEX风险问题诊断",
      "source_sample_chars": 9,
      "max_chars": 24,
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        3637963,
        416934,
        4916076,
        430887
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_38",
      "shape_id": 38,
      "shape_name": "矩形 37",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [
        34,
        36
      ],
      "source_text": "围绕流动性、交易延迟、安全与合规四类问题拆解去中心化交易痛点",
      "source_sample_chars": 30,
      "max_chars": 45,
      "typography_role": "chinese_body",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        1285874,
        1056165,
        9620252,
        301041
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_27",
      "shape_id": 27,
      "shape_name": "Text 6",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "流动性碎片化与高滑点",
      "source_sample_chars": 10,
      "max_chars": 24,
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        1244718,
        1958186,
        3262432,
        461665
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_144",
      "shape_id": 144,
      "shape_name": "Text 7",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "DEX的流动性通常分散在多个独立的资金池中，导致大额交易面临较高的滑点。例如，XBIT研究报告指出，主流DEX的大额交易（10万美元以上）平均滑点达3.2%，而中心化交易所（CEX）仅为0.05%-0.15%",
      "source_sample_chars": 104,
      "max_chars": 156,
      "typography_role": "chinese_body",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        1244718,
        2402478,
        3863668,
        1046627
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_145",
      "shape_id": 145,
      "shape_name": "Text 10",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "交易延迟与价格漂移",
      "source_sample_chars": 9,
      "max_chars": 24,
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        7043752,
        1922090,
        3262432,
        461665
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_146",
      "shape_id": 146,
      "shape_name": "Text 11",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "DEX依赖自动做市商（AMM）机制，价格更新较慢，容易受到套利机器人的攻击（MEV问题）。例如，XBIT的研究发现，套利机器人可能吞噬用户0.3%-1.2%的预期收益。\n跨链交易的原子交换确认时间较长（3-15秒），进一步加剧了价格漂移风险。",
      "source_sample_chars": 121,
      "max_chars": 181,
      "typography_role": "chinese_body",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        7043753,
        2402478,
        3973213,
        1211226
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_147",
      "shape_id": 147,
      "shape_name": "Text 14",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "安全性风险",
      "source_sample_chars": 5,
      "max_chars": 24,
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        1244718,
        4413915,
        3262432,
        461665
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_148",
      "shape_id": 148,
      "shape_name": "Text 15",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "尽管DEX强调非托管资产安全，但智能合约漏洞仍是一个重大威胁。例如，币安近期警告用户警惕DEX上的“异常高收益率”项目，这些项目可能隐藏结构性风险或欺诈行为。\n此外，DEX的去中心化特性使得监管难度增加，部分项目可能利用匿名性进行非法活动，如虚拟货币非法换汇。",
      "source_sample_chars": 130,
      "max_chars": 195,
      "typography_role": "chinese_body",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        1244719,
        4907601,
        4001424,
        1046627
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_149",
      "shape_id": 149,
      "shape_name": "Text 18",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "监管合规挑战",
      "source_sample_chars": 6,
      "max_chars": 24,
      "typography_role": "chinese_heading",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        7043752,
        4413915,
        3262432,
        461665
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "text_150",
      "shape_id": 150,
      "shape_name": "Text 19",
      "type": "text",
      "group_path": [],
      "source_text": "SEC等监管机构已明确表示，代币化资产仍需遵守证券法，这对DEX上的某些交易对（如股票代币化）构成合规障碍。\n部分DEX因缺乏KYC（了解你的客户）机制，可能被用于洗钱或\n非法资金流动。",
      "source_sample_chars": 93,
      "max_chars": 139,
      "typography_role": "chinese_body",
      "semantic_role": "provisional",
      "bounds_emu_local": [
        7043753,
        4907601,
        4125208,
        1046627
      ]
    },
